# Licensed BADA 4 approach bank/load ABORT and evidence-flush gate.
# Run only after the REPORT/ENFORCE gate passes:
# IC research/pybada-envelope-approach-abort
00:00:00.00>ECHO TEST INFO === PYBADATEM APPROACH LATERAL ABORT GATE ===
00:00:00.05>ECHO TEST INFO This gate reuses the validated PYBADA approach state and high-lift nf3/nf1 bounds.
00:00:00.10>ECHO TEST EXPECT Before the turn config is AP, HLid is 3, gear is up, and bank maximum is near 60 degrees.
00:00:00.15>ECHO TEST ERROR Stop if the observed configuration or high-lift bounds differ from the passing REPORT and ENFORCE gate.
00:00:00.20>PLUGIN LOAD PYBADATEM
00:00:00.25>PLUGIN LOAD RESEARCHRECORDER
00:00:00.30>PERFMODEL BADA4
00:00:01.00>CRE APAB,A320-232,41.30,2.10,90,5000,180
00:00:01.10>DYNAMICS APAB KINEMATIC
00:00:01.20>BADACONFIG APAB PYBADA
00:00:01.30>ALT APAB 1000 -1000
00:00:01.40>BANK APAB 70
00:00:01.50>ENVELOPECHECKS APAB CUSTOM BANK_ANGLE LOAD_FACTOR
00:00:01.60>ENVELOPE APAB ABORT
00:00:01.70>RECORDRESEARCH START pybada-envelope-approach-abort.csv
00:00:01.80>PERFSTATUS APAB BOUNDS
00:00:01.90>ECHO TEST EXPECT No QUALITY event yet because effective bank is zero outside a turn.
00:00:02.00>ECHO TEST ACTION Commanding a turn with 70 degrees. Expect one BANK_ANGLE,LOAD_FACTOR ABORTED event followed by HOLD.
00:00:02.10>HDG APAB 270
